0..78 Comment "// A method that answers a place. A method whose receiver\'s mode is a variable"
79..156 Comment "// of its implicit block, `self : m T` under `[m : Mode]`, answers a place of"
157..234 Comment "// its receiver at that mode, `View[m](a)`, its returner the one the lowering"
235..308 Comment "// inserts at a result: its body is the place, `self.#[i]`, and a call is"
309..387 Comment "// the access to it. A call with a block, `xs.first() as w { … }`, lends the"
388..468 Comment "// place at the mode the block asks — a resume or an abort through `w` asks an"
469..550 Comment "// exclusive lend, a read alone a shared one — and a call without one reads the"
551..628 Comment "// place. One body serves every mode, as an explicit object parameter deduces"
629..708 Comment "// its receiver\'s qualifiers (Ažman, Brand, Deane and Revzin, \"Deducing this\","
709..740 Comment "// C++ proposal P0847R7, 2021)."
741..743 Comment "//"
744..759 Comment "// - see: #2255"
761..795 Comment "// The list each call below holds."
